{"product_id":"the-dark-history-of-the-reincarnated-villainess-vol-6-the-dark-history-of-the-reincarnated-villainess-6","title":"The Dark History of the Reincarnated Villainess, Vol. 6 (The Dark History of the Reincarnated Villainess, 6)","description":"\u003cp\u003eIt all began with Konoha Satou’s Dark History, a fantasy romance fic written for her own satisfaction as a teen. But now, as its most odious villainess, the details are a matter of life-and-death! After somehow landing herself a fiancé following said man’s nearly fatal duel with Ginoford, Satou was looking forward to at least a short break from the craziness of Iana’s life. But when a ninja shows up claiming her requested assassin is finally available to do her bidding, she plunges into chaos once more!\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 127 x 189\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Akiharu Touka\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781975341435\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 160\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45434484392089,"sku":"Manga-A-39781975341435","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/683b23e0e8ef0-The-Dark-History-of-the-Reincarnated-Villainess-Vol-6-The-Dark-History-of-the-Rein_4920_1.jpg?v=1753121619","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-dark-history-of-the-reincarnated-villainess-vol-6-the-dark-history-of-the-reincarnated-villainess-6","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}